- The tasks the seed is planted with are written in this repository (page/seedset.js). No dataset is used, and
  nothing in a task describes a real person or company.
- The model is not part of this repository. The page fetches Llama 3.2 1B Instruct (Meta, Llama 3.2 Community
  Licence) from the MLC project's published build when the viewer presses Plant it here, and runs it with WebLLM
  (Apache 2.0), loaded from its public package. Neither is checked against a fixed fingerprint here, and the page
  says so under its limits.
- genome/io.mjs, judge.mjs, lane.mjs, health.mjs and tombstone.mjs are the estate genome's hook template
  (sjgant80-hub/estate-genome), byte for byte. genome/cell.mjs is this repository's own.
- vendor/house/ is the house kit (sjgant80-hub/house-standard), MIT, copyright Simon Gant, byte for byte: the crystal
  hero, the token sheet, the motion, the receipts reader and the ship gate the page test holds this page to.
- vendor/fonts/ holds Fraunces, Hanken Grotesk and JetBrains Mono (variable, latin), each under the SIL Open Font
  Licence 1.1; each folder carries its licence. They are served from this page so that no font host is called.
